cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Capability Should Not Undermine Authority - Authority is Granted, Not Earned: twelve small studies of whether open-model agents keep a rule when the Authorized Principal looks incompetent"
abstract: >-
  The record of twelve small studies, run from 27 September to 3 October 2026 on local open models,
  that asked whether an AI agent keeps a task owner's rule when the owner looks incompetent. It holds
  every plan, every saved request and raw model reply, and every analysis, with scripts that re-check
  the results from the saved files. The experiment is in progress and the results are interim: so far
  one effect, in one small model, in one scripted scene, and the idea the project started from was not
  supported.
authors:
  - name: "Shaleen Dev P.K."
repository-code: "https://github.com/CyberDev4/authority-granted-not-earned"
